OL,3,AAriana Grande leaves problems at home
OL,4,Aas her tour hits the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt feels inconsiderate of Ariana Grande
OL,7,Fto bring a tour called Eternal Sunshine
OL,8,Fto the UK at the tail end of the year's
OL,9,Ffifth heatwave. Haven't we suffered
OL,10,Fenough already?
OL,12,FBut the fans packed into London's O2
OL,13,Farena on Saturday night didn't seem to
OL,14,Fcare about the heat and the sweat.
OL,16,FThey came ready to dance. Thousands of
OL,17,Fthem, dressed in cat ears, bridal gowns
OL,18,Fand elaborate floral headpieces.
OL,23,APub: 16-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,160,160,100,200,0,100
