OL,3,AAriana Grande leaves problems at home
OL,4,Aas her tour hits the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey scream when she references rumours
OL,7,Fshe's back together with her ex, Ricky
OL,8,FAlvarez. And they bounce in unison when
OL,9,Fshe plays colourful club anthems like
OL,10,FInto You and Break Free.
